4. Dynin-Omni (AIDAS Lab, Seoul National University)
   https://github.com/AIDASLab/Dynin-Omni
   MIT licence, "Copyright (c) 2026 AIDAS Lab, Seoul National University".
   examples/dynin-voice/dynin-t2s-kvblock.cpp ports the per-block decode
   recipe of t2s_generate_mmu_like in that reference implementation to
   C++ on llama.cpp, and adds a block-local KV cache.
   patches/0002 registers the Dynin-Omni architecture names in the GGUF
